b2-pushall : Word → Nat → Word → Word → Word → (Word → Step W Word) → Step W Word
b2-pushall mm_ zero v ks j kq_ =
  kq_ (h4-depl mm_ (#0))
b2-pushall mm_ (suc f) v ks j kq_ =
  let a_1881 = ks in scmd (w-load ((b2-a mm_ a_1881))) (λ x_1880 → let mm_1882 = b2-dep mm_ x_1880 in let n = x_1880 in if (%weq j n) then (kq_ (h4-depl mm_1882 (#0))) else (let a_1884 = ks in let j_1885 = j in scmd (w-load ((b2-a mm_1882 (%wadd a_1884 (%wsucc j_1885))))) (λ x_1883 → let mm_1886 = b2-dep mm_1882 x_1883 in let k = x_1883 in b2-vpush mm_1886 v k (λ dd_1887 → let mm_1888 = b2-dep mm_1886 dd_1887 in b2-pushall mm_1888 f v ks (%wsucc j) kq_))))
